/**
 * x-gnosis Server
 *
 * The main server that:
 * 1. Parses nginx.conf into typed AST
 * 2. Resolves config with defaults
 * 3. Compiles into .gg topologies
 * 4. Registers handlers with GnosisEngine
 * 5. Serves requests via Aeon fork/race/fold scheduling
 *
 * Every layer uses topology-driven scheduling:
 * - Accept: fork per connection
 * - Parse: sequential PROCESS chain
 * - Resolve: race(cache, mmap, disk)
 * - Respond: fold(headers, LAMINAR(body))  ← Level 8: per-chunk codec racing
 * - Keepalive: case routing
 */

